WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Roborsi converts simulator-verified robot experience into reusable code skills.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Across LIBERO and RoboTwin, every shown rollout is tied to a named task, an exact seed, and a final simulator or task-predicate outcome.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:38.000
On one matched ACT task, corrective data changes the result from failed placement to success. Across evolving releases, adaptive coverage rises from thirty-two to eighty-three of one hundred twenty tasks.

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:54.000
When the verified visual pick-and-place skill is retained, episode success improves by seven point five percentage points, while median tokens fall twenty-nine point four percent and wall time falls seventeen percent.

5
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Verified experience becomes reusable code. Roborsi.
